OL,3,GNEWSARNLI rescue boat caught in rough
OL,4,Aconditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boat has been rescued after becoming
OL,7,Fcaught in stormy conditions
OL,9,FJersey Coastguard spotted the sailing
OL,10,Fvessel travelling south of the Demi de
OL,11,FPas lighthouse at about 16:25 BST on
OL,12,FSunday appearing to struggle.
OL,14,FThe St Helier RNLI all-weather lifeboat
OL,15,Fwas paged to assess the situation.
OL,17,FThe crew found the boat could not make
OL,18,Fmuch progress in the strong wides and
OL,19,Ftides so helped it reach St Helier,
OL,20,Frescuers said. There were no reports of
OL,21,Fany injuries.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
